	(text "WSL3637: I1/I2 = current; E1/E2 = dedicated Kelvin sense.\nDo not merge sense traces into the load-current copper.\nI/E names follow datasheet p2; footprint mapping is pending."
		(at 177.8 29.21 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "2859b846-5128-4310-8cc4-8239d2453a5e")
	)
	(text "保護IC用電源（P_R4後）"
		(at 74.93 134.62 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "28e90298-f69a-427a-ad56-84a3c03bcf9c")
	)
	(text "旧原本についての説明（下記）／現図は4端子へ修正済み\n現在のP_R101：I1・I2は主電流、E1・E2は専用検出線。\nフットプリントは未確定。ENOUTは未使用。"
		(at 25.4 210.82 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "68b619ea-ccbd-4f11-a80a-8c6daedeadb6")
	)
	(text "供給の補足：旗はP_R4後の配線上へ移設済み"
		(at 320.04 190.5 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "9697163e-6a77-484b-afb7-b47341fa0d63")
	)
	(text "SOURCE MODEL VIEW - WSL3637 (P_R101) is a two-terminal representation.\nPhysical part has four terminals; Kelvin wiring and footprint remain unqualified.\nENOUT is left open in the source model."
		(at 25.4 233.68 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "a2037bb5-6e87-4f1a-b557-f44b68a2ffae")
	)
